# Example ReRDMFT input file: LiH (r_e = 1.5949 Angstrom), 6-31G, GNOF
# with two independent PNOF coupling subspaces (see
# lih_X2C_gnof_debug.inp), followed -- HESSIAN_FUNCTIONAL TRUE -- by the
# FULL orbital-rotation Hessian of the PNOF functional at the OPTIMIZED
# occupations (Hessian_opt/PnofHessian.h's pnofHessianMatrix, including
# the L1/L2 pair terms), diagonalized to count negative/near-zero/
# positive eigenvalues, for all three SCF paths (NON_REL, X2C, C4_DHF).
# The point is stationary w.r.t. the occupations only (orbitals stay the
# converged HF/DHF ones), so the report also prints the orbital gradient.
NELEC 4
BASIS lih-6-31g.gbs
NON_RELATIVISTIC TRUE
X2C TRUE
C4_SPINOR TRUE
FUNCTIONAL GNOF
PNOF_SUBSPACES 2
PNOF_COUPLING 2
HESSIAN_FUNCTIONAL TRUE

GEOMETRY
Li  0.000000   0.000000   0.000000
H   0.000000   0.000000   1.594900
END
